  "notes": "{音量|おんりょう} refers specifically to the volume or loudness of sound.\n\nFORMS:\n{音|おん} (sound) + {量|りょう} (quantity, amount) = sound volume\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {音量|おんりょう}を{上|あ}げる: to turn up the volume\n- {音量|おんりょう}を{下|さ}げる: to turn down the volume\n- {音量|おんりょう}を{調整|ちょうせい}する: to adjust the volume\n- {音量|おんりょう}{調節|ちょうせつ}: volume control\n- {最大|さいだい}{音量|おんりょう}: maximum volume\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ボリューム: volume (loanword, commonly used)\n- {音|おと}の{大|おお}きさ: loudness (more casual)",
